  "mainHtml": "<main class=\"bg-white\"><div class=\"bg-off-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1 mb-8 pt-8 lg:mb-16 breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/de/questions\">Häufige Frage</a><i class=\"icon\">chevron_right</i><a href=\"/de/question_categories/shipping\">Transport</a></div><div class=\"lg:flex gap-16 mb-16\"><div class=\"lg:w-3/4\"><h1 class=\"font-serif text-5xl mb-8\">Transport</h1><ul class=\"bg-white rounded-lg xl:grid grid-cols-2 gap-16 p-8 test-questions\"><li class=\"mb-12 xl:mb-0\"><h2 class=\"text-xl text-semibold mb-4\"><a href=\"/de/questions/what-happens-at-the-end-of-the-auction-if-i-have-the-winning-bid_7bfa28f2-f250-4c96-af3e-768a48dd4edc\" class=\"text-green-600 hover:text-green-700 transition-colors\">What happens at the end of the auction if I have the winning bid?</a></h2><p class=\"mb-4\">As the winning bidder, you will first pay your fee to Bidders Highway, and once this has been done, Bidders Highway will digitally make an introduction so that you can get each other's contact information, to arrange how payment and delivery will take place.</p><a href=\"/de/questions/what-happens-at-the-end-of-the-auction-if-i-have-the-winning-bid_7bfa28f2-f250-4c96-af3e-768a48dd4edc\" class=\"underline hover:text-neutral-800\">Mehr erfahren</a></li><li class=\"mb-12 xl:mb-0\"><h2 class=\"text-xl text-semibold mb-4\"><a href=\"/de/questions/what-happens-if-the-bidding-doesnt-reach-the-reserve-price_88960487-d401-4c3a-8534-b3973c6e6007\" class=\"text-green-600 hover:text-green-700 transition-colors\">What happens if the bidding doesn't reach the reserve price?</a></h2><p class=\"mb-4\">If the reserve is not met, the three highest bidders will have the opportunity to place a final bid or meet the reserve price after the auction. These bids are then valid for 24 hours so that we have the opportunity to convey this to the seller. It is always first come, first served and often things go quickly, so it is important to check your email and respond quickly. If the seller chooses to...</p><a href=\"/de/questions/what-happens-if-the-bidding-doesnt-reach-the-reserve-price_88960487-d401-4c3a-8534-b3973c6e6007\" class=\"underline hover:text-neutral-800\">Mehr erfahren</a></li><li class=\"mb-12 xl:mb-0\"><h2 class=\"text-xl text-semibold mb-4\"><a href=\"/de/questions/what-happens-after-the-auction-ends-if-my-vehicle-is-sold_19f4f7ea-e7aa-446e-9c32-49d46ecfa30f\" class=\"text-green-600 hover:text-green-700 transition-colors\">What happens after the auction ends if my vehicle is sold?</a></h2><p class=\"mb-4\">Once your vehicle has reached the desired reserve price and the auction is closed, Bidders Highway will first contact the buyer to charge the fee. Once this has been paid, we will make a digital introduction between buyer and seller to complete the payment and agree on the handover of the vehicle.</p><a href=\"/de/questions/what-happens-after-the-auction-ends-if-my-vehicle-is-sold_19f4f7ea-e7aa-446e-9c32-49d46ecfa30f\" class=\"underline hover:text-neutral-800\">Mehr erfahren</a></li><li class=\"mb-12 xl:mb-0\"><h2 class=\"text-xl text-semibold mb-4\"><a href=\"/de/questions/what-does-the-transport-available-label-mean-on-a-listing_019bc6d8-a482-7a23-96c1-094e54ef0858\" class=\"text-green-600 hover:text-green-700 transition-colors\">What does the Transport available label mean on a listing?</a></h2><p class=\"mb-4\">It indicates that either the seller can arrange transport, or we work with independent transport partners who cover the location where the item is stored. Bidders Highway does not provide transport services itself.</p><a href=\"/de/questions/what-does-the-transport-available-label-mean-on-a-listing_019bc6d8-a482-7a23-96c1-094e54ef0858\" class=\"underline hover:text-neutral-800\">Mehr erfahren</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"lg:w-1/4 mt-8 mb-8 lg:mt-0\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-6\">Kategorien</h2><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 lg:block\"><li><a href=\"/de/questions\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Alle</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/buying\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Einkaufen</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/selling\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Verkaufen</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/bidding\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Bieten</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/documentation\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Dokumentation</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/account\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Konto</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/payment\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Zahlungen</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/shipping\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent px-2 border-black! text-black! hover:text-black!\">Transport</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/verification\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Verifizierung</a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 pb-16\"><div class=\"w-full p-8 bg-amber-100 rounded sm:flex justify-between items-center\"><div><h2 class=\"font-serif text-2xl sm:text-4xl mb-4\">Weitere Fragen?</h2><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base mb-2 sm:mb-8\">Sie können uns eine E-Mail senden. Wir helfen Ihnen gerne weiter!</p><a href=\"mailto:support@biddershighway.com\" class=\"font-bold underline hover:text-neutral-800\">support@biddershighway.com</a></div><a href=\"mailto:support@biddershighway.com\" class=\"hidden sm:block\"><img src=\"/assets/contact-us-4411369c.svg\" alt=\"Contact us\" class=\"w-48 h-36\"></a></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 text-center py-8\"><a href=\"/de\" class=\"inline-block rounded-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors px-4 py-2 text-white bg-jaffa hover:bg-zest disabled:bg-yellow-700 disabled:text-neutral-300 px-6 py-3\">Alle unsere Autoauktionen ansehen</a></div></div></main>",
